                        "description": "Retrieve the current cryptocurrency balance for a specific currency or all supported\ncryptocurrencies. Use this endpoint to query available and pending balances across\ndifferent crypto assets.\n\n---\n\n## Additional Info\n\n**Rate Limit** \ud83d\udcd6 Learn More\n\nWeight: 1\n\n**Pending Balance Explained**\n\nThe `pending_balance` represents funds that are not immediately available for trading or\nwithdrawal. This typically includes Deposit Confirmations, Pending Withdrawals,\nProcessing Transactions, and Order-Related Locks.\n\n**Use Cases** \ud83e\udde9 SDK\n\n- **Deposit Tracking** \u2014 Monitor pending balance to track deposit confirmations.\n- **Withdrawal Verification** \u2014 Check pending balance before initiating new withdrawals.\n\n**Best Practices**\n\n- Use specific currency parameter when checking single asset.\n- Cache results appropriately (30\u201360 seconds for pending balance).\n- Don't poll more frequently than necessary (respect rate limits).\n- Use WebSocket for real-time balance updates if available."
                      },
