                    "description": "Retrieve comprehensive information about trading account, including permissions,\nbalances, withdrawal limits (daily, monthly, annual), fee tier, and configuration settings.\nUse this endpoint to get a complete snapshot of account's current state for portfolio\nmanagement, compliance checks, and monitoring.\n\n**Permission Flags**\n\n- **canDeposit**: `true` = Account can receive deposits; `false` = Deposits are blocked\n(reasons: pending verification, compliance hold, security review).\n- **canTrade**: `true` = Account can execute buy/sell orders; `false` = Trading is restricted\n(reasons: KYC incomplete, account suspension, regulatory restrictions).\n- **canWithdraw**: `true` = Account can withdraw funds; `false` = Withdrawals are blocked\n(reasons: security review, 2FA setup required, compliance hold).\n\n---\n\n## Additional Info\n\n**Rate Limit** \ud83d\udcd6 Learn More\n\nWeight: 10\n\n**Use Cases** \ud83e\udde9 SDK\n\n- **Withdrawal Validation** \u2014 Check if withdrawal amount is within limits before submission.\n- **Trading Permission Check** \u2014 Verify account can trade before placing orders.\n- **Compliance Monitoring** \u2014 Track transaction limits for regulatory compliance.\n- **Balance Verification** \u2014 Confirm available balance before placing trades.\n\n**Best Practices**\n\n- Cache account information and refresh after transactions.\n- Use `updateTime` to track data freshness.\n- Always check `canTrade` before placing orders.\n- Always check `canWithdraw` before initiating withdrawals.\n- Check all three limit tiers (daily, monthly, annual)."
                  },
